			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διόπτρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.105
			</span></i>.</div>
